<title>USA: FFLC Bancorp sets additional repurchase.</title>
<headline>FFLC Bancorp sets additional repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>LEESBURG, Fla. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>FFLC Bancorp Inc said on Wednesday that its board approved an additional repurchase of 10 percent of the company's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The number of shares authorized in the latest repurchase program is 238,792, representing 10 percent of the 2,387,925 shares outstanding upon completion of the previous repurchase programs, it said.</p>
<p>The company had repurchased 240,712 shares or 93.5 percent of the number of shares it was authorized to repurchase in 1996.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
